  description: 'Where the port starts: the 2011 WebGL demo''s analytic tiled pool,
    rebuilt on the GPU heightfield solver with projected floor caustics. No buoyancy
    and no props - just the surface. Transparency and refraction here are FAKE and
    displayed onto water surface. Pool is an analytical mesh , fog is faked into
    water pool shader . '
